{"4615780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "13 MASCA", "steam_appid": 4615780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615780/extras/1cbf01c47ee64d7438d80329fd2afd91.avif?t=1784011074\" width=375 height=125 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>1. </strong>Investigate the<strong> Unusual Individual</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615780/extras/926e95c68682044aeba3c5e50e457790.poster.avif?t=1784011074\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615780/extras/926e95c68682044aeba3c5e50e457790.webm?t=1784011074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615780/extras/926e95c68682044aeba3c5e50e457790.mp4?t=1784011074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Among 13 completely different individuals, identify those <strong>who seem… off.</strong> <br>You have <u>295 seconds.</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>2.</strong> Choose Someone to <strong>Expel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615780/extras/327885186ffae6674d7b6976bdf17d1f.poster.avif?t=1784011074\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615780/extras/327885186ffae6674d7b6976bdf17d1f.webm?t=1784011074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615780/extras/327885186ffae6674d7b6976bdf17d1f.mp4?t=1784011074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once the investigation ends, select one person you find suspicious and <strong>expel them.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>3. </strong>Verify<strong> </strong>Through<strong> CCTV</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615780/extras/788f53b8d364f8206fbbda68f14732d6.poster.avif?t=1784011074\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615780/extras/788f53b8d364f8206fbbda68f14732d6.webm?t=1784011074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615780/extras/788f53b8d364f8206fbbda68f14732d6.mp4?t=1784011074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Out of 4 suspicious individuals, only one is correct. <br>If you chose correctly, they will leave without incident… <br>But if you’re wrong… <strong>something strange will happen.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>4. </strong>Escape the<strong> Monster</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615780/extras/ad431100098cfd6ba23a378450f4c536.poster.avif?t=1784011074\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615780/extras/ad431100098cfd6ba23a378450f4c536.webm?t=1784011074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615780/extras/ad431100098cfd6ba23a378450f4c536.mp4?t=1784011074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If something feels off, leave the CCTV room immediately and <strong>run!</strong> <br>In this enclosed space, that person will turn into a monster and roam the facility. <br>Survive long enough, and a <strong>beam of light</strong> will appear over an escape pit—your only way out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>5. </strong>The <strong>Investigation</strong> <strong>Continues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615780/extras/1fcb2d600e98fa0a87cb83611a697865.poster.avif?t=1784011074\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615780/extras/1fcb2d600e98fa0a87cb83611a697865.webm?t=1784011074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4615780/extras/1fcb2d600e98fa0a87cb83611a697865.mp4?t=1784011074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you survive, the day will repeat, allowing you to gradually narrow down the correct answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">However, if you’re caught by the monster—or fall into the pit before the light appears—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">it’s game over, and the <strong>correct answer will change.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">So when you make the wrong choice, observe the monster’s traits and focus on surviving as long as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p cla